checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>；沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9eb88cb14d7f1646\" href=\"?note=9eb88cb14d7f1646\" title=\"72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness\">72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness</a> 的语法、保护谓词和可证性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Guard}_i(A)\\land\n\\bigl(\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(B\\leftrightarrow_m A[B/p_i])\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(C\\leftrightarrow_m A[C/p_i])\\bigr)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(B\\leftrightarrow_m C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Guard}_i(A)\\land\n\\bigl(\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(B\\leftrightarrow_m A[B/p_i])\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(C\\leftrightarrow_m A[C/p_i])\\bigr)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(B\\leftrightarrow_m C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将两个已证明的等价合取，并对这个定理作必然化，得到唯一性公式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boxdot\">\\(\\boxdot\\)</span> 前件；一次 MP 得结论。这里的必然化作用于定理，未作用于未解除假设。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness","status":"resolved","id":"9eb88cb14d7f1646","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness","status":"resolved","id":"9eb88cb14d7f1646","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$i\\in\\omega$；沿用 [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]] 的语法、保护谓词和可证性。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Guard}_i(A)\\land\n\\bigl(\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(B\\leftrightarrow_m A[B/p_i])\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(C\\leftrightarrow_m A[C/p_i])\\bigr)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(B\\leftrightarrow_m C).","display":true},{"tex":"\\boxdot","display":false}],"bytes":1396,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-151","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-525","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-520","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic